Switch to HBA Mode

---

Resetting the iDRAC on a Dell PowerEdge T440 can be done without rebooting the server. The easiest method is to press and hold the System Identification (i) button on the front or rear panel for at least 16 seconds until the fans spin at full speed

(root / calvin) https://192.168.1.37/restgui/start.html

